	<item>
		<title>International Championship Match added to AEW Full Gear PPV</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397024-international-championship-match-added-to-aew-full-gear-ppv/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397024-international-championship-match-added-to-aew-full-gear-ppv/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:38:49 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Adam Copeland]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Full Gear]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[International Championship Match]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397024</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Kazuchika Okada defending the AEW International Championship has been added to next Saturday&#8217;s Full Gear pay-per-view. The men&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397024-international-championship-match-added-to-aew-full-gear-ppv/">International Championship Match added to AEW Full Gear PPV</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Kazuchika Okada defending the AEW International Championship has been added to next Saturday&#8217;s Full Gear pay-per-view.  The men competed in Blood and Guts last Wednesday. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back on the October 21 episode of Dynamite, Copeland teamed with Will Ospreay against Kyle Fletcher and Kevin Knight, that saw Okada interfere and then putting the International Championship belt on a turnbuckle which then saw Copeland hit his head on, costing Copeland and Ospreay the match.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Below is the current lineup for Full Gear. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-AEW World Championship Match: Will Ospreay defends against Kyle Fletcher</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-AEW Women’s World Championship Match: Mercedes Mone defends against Marina Shafir</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-AEW World Tag Team Championship Match: Young Bucks (Matt Jackson and Nick Jackson) defends against Mark Davis and Jake Doyle of the Don Callis Family</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-AEW Women’s World Tag Team Championship Match: The Brawling Birds (Jamie Hayter and Alex Windsor) defends against Wrathlander (Kris Statlander and Harley Cameron)</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-AEW World Trios Championships Texas Death Match: Hangman Page, Brody King and Bandido defend against Swerve Strickland &amp; The New Level (Kofi and Austin Creed) </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-AEW International Championship Match: Kazuchika Okada defends against Adam Copeland</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Anarchy in the Arena: The Death Riders an The Conglomeration vs. The Cut </p>


<p>AEW Full Gear airs live on pay-per-view on Saturday, November 14 from the Mortgage Matchup Center in Phoenix, Arizona.</p><p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397024-international-championship-match-added-to-aew-full-gear-ppv/">International Championship Match added to AEW Full Gear PPV</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/397024-international-championship-match-added-to-aew-full-gear-ppv/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>MLW Saturday Night Superfight Quick Results &#8211; 11/7/26 (New Champion Crowned, Court Bauer teases &#8220;Special Project&#8221; for 2027)</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397018-mlw-saturday-night-superfight-quick-results-11-7-26-new-champion-crowned-court-bauer-teases-special-project-for-2027/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397018-mlw-saturday-night-superfight-quick-results-11-7-26-new-champion-crowned-court-bauer-teases-special-project-for-2027/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 04:21:38 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Misc. News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[11/7 MLW Saturday Superfight Quick Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[MLW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Saturday Superfight]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=397018</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Below are the quick results from the MLW Saturday Night Superfight from the sold-out Cicero Stadium in Cicero,&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397018-mlw-saturday-night-superfight-quick-results-11-7-26-new-champion-crowned-court-bauer-teases-special-project-for-2027/">MLW Saturday Night Superfight Quick Results &#8211; 11/7/26 (New Champion Crowned, Court Bauer teases &#8220;Special Project&#8221; for 2027)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Below are the quick results from the MLW Saturday Night Superfight from the sold-out <a href="https://mlw.com/2026/11/06/saturday-night-superfight-preview/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cicero Stadium</a> in Cicero, Illinois, which streamed live on VEEPS.  MLW Founder Court Bauer also teased a &#8220;special project&#8221; for 2027.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-MLW Tag Team Championships – Street Fight: Good Brothers (Karl Anderson and Doc Gallows) defeated Glasgow Boys On Top (Joe Coffey and Mark Coffey to retain.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Masha Slamovich def. ZAMAYA</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Tessa Blanchard def. Keyra</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-MLW National Openweight Championship: Austin Aries vs. Matt Riddle ended in a 30-minute time limit draw. Aries said he knows everyone wants five more minutes and says know. Riddle knocks him out and takes the title.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Ultimo Guerrero def. Templario and Titan</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Court Bauer thanks everyone attending. He brings out NJPW Chairman Naoki Sugabayashi. Court says MLW, NJPW, and CMLL are working on a big surprise for 2027 before introducing Yota Tsuji.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">MLW <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f91d.png" alt="🤝" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> NJPW<br><br>BIG things are coming!!<br><br>Order now: <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f4fa.png" alt="📺" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> <a href="https://t.co/BISft0S5FV">https://t.co/BISft0S5FV</a> <a href="https://t.co/QdJgp1eKNT">pic.twitter.com/QdJgp1eKNT</a></p>&mdash; MLW (@MLW) <a href="https://x.com/MLW/status/2119262618515014141?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Yota Tsuji def. Trevor Lee</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-MLW Championship – Last Man Standing: Josh Bishop def. Killer Kross to become the new champion</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list"></ul>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">THE BLOOD KING’S REIGN IS OVER!<a href="https://x.com/JoshuaBishop_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@JoshuaBishop_</a> is the Last Man Standing!<br><br>Replay <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1fa78.png" alt="🩸" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> <a href="https://t.co/BISft0S5FV">https://t.co/BISft0S5FV</a> <a href="https://t.co/Da6J5LB5Up">pic.twitter.com/Da6J5LB5Up</a></p>&mdash; MLW (@MLW) <a href="https://x.com/MLW/status/2119275694249386101?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://www.fightful.com/wrestling/mlw-saturday-night-superfight-results-11-7-killer-kross-yota-tsuji-tessa-blanchard-compete/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Fightful</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/misc-news/397018-mlw-saturday-night-superfight-quick-results-11-7-26-new-champion-crowned-court-bauer-teases-special-project-for-2027/">MLW Saturday Night Superfight Quick Results &#8211; 11/7/26 (New Champion Crowned, Court Bauer teases &#8220;Special Project&#8221; for 2027)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
