			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>Title changes hands at AEW Collision from Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager At Sea</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396995-title-changes-hands-at-aew-collision-from-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396995-title-changes-hands-at-aew-collision-from-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 03:33:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Collision]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Rock N Wrestling Rager At Sea]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[title change]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=396995</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>The 11/7 edition of AEW Collision emanated from the Chris Jericho&#8217;s Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager At Sea, docked&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396995-title-changes-hands-at-aew-collision-from-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/">Title changes hands at AEW Collision from Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager At Sea</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The 11/7 edition of AEW Collision emanated from the Chris Jericho&#8217;s Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager At Sea, docked in Miami for the night before setting out to sail this weekend.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The main event saw Andrade El Idolo defend the AEW National Championship against Tommaso Ciampa.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As recapped by Jerome Wilen in his <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/396827-aew-collision-results-11-7-26-live-from-chris-jerichos-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/">live coverage of the show</a>, Ciampa rolled up Andrade for the three count, winning the title just as the rain in Miami started to come down harder.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This marks Ciampa&#8217;s second singles championship since joining AEW, previously winning the TNT Championship in his first match with the company.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr"><a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AndNEW?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AndNEW</a> <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f3c6.png" alt="🏆" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> “The Psycho Killer” <a href="https://x.com/MrTommasoCiampa?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@MrTommasoCiampa</a> dethrones Andrade El Ídolo to become the NEW AEW National Champion!<br><br>Watch the <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager replay on HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/jNzbPQZUE9">pic.twitter.com/jNzbPQZUE9</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119265971030348285?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Ciampa made the following comments after his title win.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">“Ten months in AEW, and I’m rewriting the damn playbook. You can call me the history maker.”<br><br>EXCLUSIVE: <a href="https://x.com/MrTommasoCiampa?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@MrTommasoCiampa</a> is the NEW AEW National Champion after a battle at sea on <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager! <a href="https://t.co/Y96ZPVV9on">pic.twitter.com/Y96ZPVV9on</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119275878639161434?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396995-title-changes-hands-at-aew-collision-from-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/">Title changes hands at AEW Collision from Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager At Sea</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396995-title-changes-hands-at-aew-collision-from-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>AEW Collision Results &#8211; 11/7/26 (Live From Chris Jericho&#8217;s Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager at Sea)</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/396827-aew-collision-results-11-7-26-live-from-chris-jerichos-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/396827-aew-collision-results-11-7-26-live-from-chris-jerichos-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 00:03:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW Collision Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[11/7/26 AEW Collision Results]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW Collision]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Chris Jericho]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Rock 'N' Rager at Sea]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=396827</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>AEW Collision ResultsNovember 7, 2026 Chris Jericho&#8217;s Cruise Ship &#8211; Norwegian Jewel in Miami, FloridaResults by: Jerome Wilen&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/396827-aew-collision-results-11-7-26-live-from-chris-jerichos-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/">AEW Collision Results &#8211; 11/7/26 (Live From Chris Jericho&#8217;s Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager at Sea)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>AEW Collision Results</strong><br><strong>November 7, 2026 <br><strong>Chris Jericho&#8217;s Cruise Ship &#8211; Norwegian Jewel in Miami, Florida</strong><br><strong>Results by: Jerome Wilen of Wrestleview.com</strong></strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We go live the Norwegian Jewel, Tony Schiavone, Nigel McGuinness and Paul Wight welcome us to the show, with a hot crowd!  Standing near the ringside area, commentary gives us a run down of tonight&#8217;s card.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The music of Chris Jericho hits, as the fans start singing along to his theme music, as the former AEW World Champion makes his way out and down to the ring, not in his usual ring gear. Looks like a work outfit. Next up, the music of Blake Christian. He makes his way out with Jay Lethal, as the fans boo loudly. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Chris Jericho vs. Blake Christian</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The bell rings, as Blake attacks Jericho from behind. Blake has Jericho in the corner, laying into him. As Blake distracts the ref, it allows Lethal to choke Jericho. Blake runs the ropes and is caught by Jericho and slammed down. Blake rolls to the outsider. Jericho takes off his outfit and reveals taco shirt and shorts. He leaps off the top and lands on Blake. Jericho grabs something from fans (commentary didn&#8217;t know what it was either) and hits Blake. Both men are on the apron&#8230;Blake takes out Jericho, sending him to the outside. As Jericho tries to get back in, Blake kicks back to the floor, as Jericho lands on his back.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-FULL AD BREAK (ON HBO MAX)-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, Jericho is down in the ring, as Blake is on the top rope, but Jericho sends him down. Jericho chops Blake and lays a bunch of right hands into Blake as the fans count along. Jericho sends Blake down with a couple of lariats. Blake comes back and comes off the ropes with a spring board moonsault. Blake covers Jericho for just a one count. Blake kicks Jericho in the back of the head. Blake comes off the top with a 450, landing on Jericho for only a two count. Jericho and Blake exchange chops and blows to the head. Blake snaps Jericho down and drop kicks Jericho in the back. Blake counters a walls of Jericho. Blake rolls up Jericho for only a two count. Blake misses with a back elbow, but then connects with a cutter on Jericho and covers him for a near fall. Blake on the apron, connects with a kick on Jericho. Blake leaps over the ropes and is caught by Jericho who puts Blake into the walls of Jericho, as Blake taps out.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Winner by submission: Chris Jericho</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After the match, Referee Aubrey Edwards helps Jericho removes some of his shirt, as the fans sing along to Jericho&#8217;s ring entrance music. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">.<a href="https://x.com/IAmJericho?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@IamJericho</a> packed his vacation attire! <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f60e.png" alt="😎" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/QSY1ybLcwn">pic.twitter.com/QSY1ybLcwn</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119235304452210709?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We go to a Nick Wayne beat Chris Jericho vignette. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">THE BRAGGING NEVER STOPS!<br><br>Before facing Marcus Mathers TONIGHT, <a href="https://x.com/thenickwayne?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@thenickwayne</a> has one more reminder for everyone&#8230;<br><br>NICK WAYNE MOGS JERICHO AT SEA!<br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/E3CBsjRFdc">pic.twitter.com/E3CBsjRFdc</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119239677207060935?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In the ring, Lexy Nair welcomes The New Level as they walks out an down to the ring. Lexy asked New Level if they feel Swerve has manipulated them into getting into a Texas Death Match. Austin Creed says Bandido started it and the problem is now with Bandido. Kofi says he knows how much Swerve hates Hangman. He says they did not want a Texas Death Match. Kofi says they don&#8217;t want their careers cut short. They are scared. Kofi says they are not scared of Hangman, Brody or Bandido. They are afraid of what they have to become to win the match. Creed says next week they will go to a place they have never gone before. Next week they are going to a New Level. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">The New Level give their thoughts on TEXAS DEATH at <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWFullGear?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWFullGear</a>…<br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/1MgeDmf7Rs">pic.twitter.com/1MgeDmf7Rs</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119241463313608947?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Video recap airs of this past Wednesday&#8217;s Blood and Guts episode of Dynamite.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">A NIGHT OF BLOOD &amp; GUTS!<br><br>The brutality lived up to its name! Blood was spilled, shocking moments unfolded, and the road to <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWFullGear?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWFullGear</a> is now paved with BLOOD, CHAOS, AND CARNAGE!<br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/ulWqRUQsQr">pic.twitter.com/ulWqRUQsQr</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119241961701888481?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-COMMERCIAL BREAK-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, the music of FTR hits, as they make their way to the ring. Stokley is plugging his nose while walking to the ring. Next up, the music of Motor City Machine Guns hit, as they make their way out and down to the ring. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Match Four in the Best of Five Series: FTR (Dax Harwood and Cash Wheeler) vs. The Motor City Machine Guns (Chris Sabin and Alex Shelley)</strong> <strong>&#8211; MCMG leads 2-1</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Before the match starts we get a dual Motor City/FTR chant&#8230;the bell rings as Dax and Sabin start up, lock up. Dax and Sabin exchange chops. Shelley is tagged in. MCMG double team FTR. Dax nails Shelley as the action goes to the floor. Shelley fights off Cash and Dax. Dax takes down Shelley with a dragon screw. Cash is tagged in, as he works on the leg of Shelley. Cash tags in Dax. Dax works on the leg of Shelley, keeping him in their corner and working on the knee. Cash is tagged in, keeping Shelley from making a tag. Cash grabs Shelley and comes down with a big foot to the chest. Cash comes off the ropes, but Shelley gets his legs up. Dax is tagged in, as Shelley makes the tag! Sabin takes down Cash and then takes down Dax. Sabin connects with a big boot to the face of Dax, then lays rights into Cash. Sabin takes down Dax. Sabin fights of both Dax and Cash. Sabin rolls up Dax for a two count.  Dax comes back and connects with a cross body on Sabin. On the outside, Cash grabs Shelley and continues the assault on his knee. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-FULL AD BREAK (ON HBO MAX)-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, Sabin is fighting off Cash, but its not enough as FTR piledrives Sabin. Cash covers Sabin for a two count. On the floor, Dax kicks the knee of Shelley, as he is down. Sabin is down, as Dax cuts of Sabin from making a tag. Sabin fights back, butt is cut off again from making a tag. Shelley is back up on the apron and fired up! Shelley sends Cash to the outside. Down goes Shelley, as Dax nails him. Sabin rolls up Dax, but he kicks out at two. Dax comes back and slams down Sabin and covers him for only a two count. Dax comes down off the second rope, as Sabin moves and tags in Shelley! Shelley chops Dax in the corner. Shelley sends Dax into the ropes and then rolls him up for a two count. Dax comes back, but Shelley attempts a pin, but Dax kicks out. Shelley chops Dax. Cash is in, Sabin is in. Cash sends Sabin to the outside. Dax applies the sharpshooter on Shelley, but Sabin breaks the hold with a thrust kick on Dax. Sabin and Cash tumble to the outside. Shelley has the Boder City Stretch locked in on Dax. Sabin blocks Cash and applies a Border City Stretch on Cash. The holds are broken. Stoke pulls on the leg of Shelley, as it distracts him, allowing Dax to roll up Shelley for the win. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Winners by pinfall: FTR</strong> <strong>&#8211; Series tied 2-2</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Video package airs hyping up the World Title Match at Full Gear</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">A FRIENDSHIP FRACTURED. A RIVALRY BORN. A WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP AT STAKE!<a href="https://x.com/WillOspreay?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@WillOspreay</a> defends the <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEW?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEW</a> World Title against <a href="https://x.com/kylefletcherpro?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@kylefletcherpro</a> NEXT SATURDAY at <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWFullGear?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWFullGear</a>!<br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/OhEpRy1hjr">pic.twitter.com/OhEpRy1hjr</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119247326711529516?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Arkady Aura introduces Nick Wayne, who makes his way out and down to the ring to a string of boos. He is wearing his Nick Wayne Beat Chris Jericho T-Shirt. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">.<a href="https://x.com/thenickwayne?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@theNickWayne</a> has officially arrived on the Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager! <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f60e.png" alt="😎" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/slA7LG0i9o">pic.twitter.com/slA7LG0i9o</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119247180812701977?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Nick Wayne vs. Marcus Mathers</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The bell sounds, as Wayne and Marcus lock up. Wayne sends Mathers to the corner. Wayne pounds Mathers down with kicks to the mid-section. Wayne connects on Mathers with a standing sliced bread and then cover him for a two count. Wayne attempts to picks up Mathers but he reverses it. Mathers connects with a big drop kick on Wayne. Mathers leaps and connects on Wayne. Wayne comes back and hits Mathers with a spin kick. Wayne chops Mathers. Wayne goes for a thrust kick, but misses. Mathers takes Wayne down, as he hits the apron, then goes to the outside.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-FULL AD BREAK (ON HBO MAX)-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, Mathers takes down Wayne with a big lariat. As Wayne gets up, Mathers sends him down again. Mathers kicks Wayne in the head. Mathers is up on the top, but Wayne leaps up and catches Mathers. Wayne comes off the top rope with Mathers for a big superplex. Both men are down. Mathers forward rolls up Wayne, but he kicks out at two. Mathers comes off the top, but Wayne connects with a kicks to the mid-section. Wayne recovers and connects with a Wayne&#8217;s World on Mathers for the win.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Winner by pinfall: Nick Wayne</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After the match, grabs a mic and says he is the captain of the ship because he beat Chris Jericho. The fans tell him to &#8220;shut the f&#8211;up.&#8221; Instead of the pyro going off when he says he beat Chris Jericho, we get a horn instead. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">“<a href="https://x.com/thenickwayne?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@TheNickWayne</a> has been winmaxxing.” <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f629.png" alt="😩" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/VfLuzwwmqm">pic.twitter.com/VfLuzwwmqm</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119249873799086151?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We go to a video package of ROH talent Brady Booker on season 51 of CBS&#8217; Survivor.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">OUTWIT. OUTPLAY. OUTLAST. OUTWRESTLE!<br><br>After being pushed to his limits on Season 51 of <a href="https://x.com/survivorcbs?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@survivorcbs</a>, <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEW?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEW</a> and <a href="https://x.com/ringofhonor?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@ringofhonor</a> developmental star <a href="https://x.com/bradybooker_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@bradybooker_</a> is ready to turn his focus to the competition in <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEW?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEW</a>!<br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/H8M5vQeMrX">pic.twitter.com/H8M5vQeMrX</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119250906088620087?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The music of the Death Riders hits, as Jon Moxley, Gabe Kidd and Daniel Garcia make their way to the ring. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Trios match:</strong> <strong>Death Riders (Jon Moxley, Daniel Garcia and Gabe Kidd) vs. Shane Taylor Promotions</strong> (<strong>Shane Taylor and the Infantry &#8211; Carlie Bravo and Sean Dean)</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The bell rings, as we start off with a brawl in the ring. After some order is restored, Bravo chops Mox in the corner, but he comes back with a scoop slam on Bravo. Kidd is tagged in. He lands on Bravo and covers him for a two count. Kidd headbutts Bravo in the chest. Garcia is tagged in. He lays rights into Bravo. Dean comes in only to be sent to the outside. Shane Taylor is tagged in. He picks up Garcia and slam him down and then sends Mox to the outside. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-FULL AD BREAK (ON HBO MAX)-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, Garcia grabs Shane and slams him down! Garcia craws the corner and tags in Moxley. Both Shane and Mox slug it out in the center of the ring. Mox headbutts Shane, but he comes back with chops. Mox bits Shane in the forehead and then lays lefts and rights on Shane. Infantry is in, but Mox double DDTs them. Kidd is tagged in, as the Death Riders lay into Shane in the corner. Kidd runs the ropes and drops Taylor with a huge left handed lariat! The action goes to the outside. Kidd gets distracted as Infantry takes down Kidd. Taylor comes off the second rope, landing on Kidd. He covers him for only a two count. Moxley drops Taylor with a cutter. Kidd is tagged in. He picks up Bravo who is legal and drops him with a fisherman&#8217;s buster and gets the pin and the win for his team.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Winners by pinfall: Death Riders</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After the match, Mox grabs a mic and says the odds for the Death Riders are not looking good. Mox says they will make The Cut earn it. The music of Mercedes Mone&#8217; hits as she walks out with a mic. She asks the Death Riders where Marina is. Mone&#8217;s says she will embarrass Marina and when she beats Marina at Full Gear she tells Mox to keep his b&#8212; on a leash. Mox says they are not going to take it personally. Mox tells Mone&#8217; that she must be flustered as most women do when they are around Danny Garcia. Mox says even his mom gets that way. Mox tells Mone&#8217; they are families and children on the boat and to not use that kind of foul language. (The stuff from Moxley to Mone&#8217; about Garcia and the foul language was hilarious). </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The music of Jay White hits, as the rest of The Cut make their out and surround the ring. We get a brawl with The Cut and the Death Riders. White goes after Moxley, as the numbers are too much. The Cut stand tall in the ring. Juice Robinson and Ace Austin take Moxley down, as Mone&#8217; looks on laughing. Moxley is taken down again, while Mone&#8217; is shown clapping and smiling. Garcia and Kidd are still laid out, as The Cut continue their assault on Moxley. Jay White tells the fans he will talk as much as he wants. White says they will take what is theirs at Full Gear. Mone&#8217; enters the ring and kicks Moxley in the head. White drops Moxley with a blade runner, as The Cut and Mone&#8217; stand tall in the ring.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-COMMERCIAL BREAK-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, Persephone makes her way out and down to the ring. Next up, Mina Shirakawa who makes her way to the ring. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Persephone vs. Mina Shirakawa</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The bell rings, as Persephone jaws with Mina before both women lock up. Mina has a double wrist lock on Persephone, trying to take her down, but Persephone breaks the hold. Persephone takes Mina, but she fires back with kicks to legs of Persephone taking her down. Mina runs the ropes and takes down Persephone. Mina rolls up Persephone for only a two count. Mina is on the apron. Persephone runs to the ropes, but Mina sends her down. Mina comes down with a big crossbody on Persephone. Mina kicks Persephone in the mid-section. Persephone kicks the left arm of Mina and picks her up and drops her face first on the top turnbuckle. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-FULL AD BREAK (ON HBO MAX)-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, Persephone lays into Mina and uses the ropes to work on the right arm of Mina. Mina comes back with a slingblade on Persephone, then a back elbow. Mina connects with a shotgun drop kick on Persephone. Mina covers her for only a two count. Mina attempts a dragon screw, but Persephone moves and then connects with a cutter on Mina. Persephone covers Mina for only a two count. Mina hits a dragon screw on Persephone. She hits Mina with a huge lariat! Mina kicks Persephone in the back of the head. Persephone comes back and German Suplexes Mina and tries for a pin, but Mina kicks out at two. Mina hits Persephone with a tornado DDT. Mina comes back with a second DDT and covers Persephone, but she gets her foot on the bottom rope. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Persephone is on the apron and is taken down with a back elbow. Mina gets distracted and it allow Persephone to take down Mina and then come off the top with a big frog splash for the pin.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Winner by pinfall: Persephone </strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"> After the match, Persephone assaults Mina. The music of Queen Aminata&#8217;s music hits as she power walks down to the ring to make the save. Persephone shouts at Aminata that the TBS Title is hers. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We go back stage as Lexy is with The Cut while there is blood everywhere. Juice Robinson has been taken to the hospital. White says they will find the Death Riders. They are two forks shown on the ground in the blood. White picks up a fork, as The Cut walk off. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">&quot;WE ARE GONNA MAKE SURE THAT EVERY LAST DROP FROM THEIR BODY IS FRESHLY SQUEEZED!&quot;<br><br>Juice Robinson has been taken out, and The Cut have found the fork from last week!<br><br>NOW THEY WANT REVENGE!<br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/g9Em8os6QQ">pic.twitter.com/g9Em8os6QQ</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119260727236051011?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-COMMERCIAL BREAK-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, commentary runs down the lineup for Full Gear.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We go to a backstage promo with Davis and Doyle saying they will take the World Tag Team Championships from the Young Bucks at Full Gear.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">THEY TOOK THEIR PRIDE. THEY TOOK THEIR BLOOD!<a href="https://x.com/DUNKZILLADavis?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@DUNKZILLADavis</a> and <a href="https://x.com/JakeSomething_?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@JakeSomething_</a> have a warning for <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEW?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEW</a> World Tag Team Champions <a href="https://x.com/youngbucks?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@youngbucks</a>!<br><br>The titles are on the line NEXT SATURDAY at <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWFullGear?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWFullGear</a>!<br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/Eq6cy7AyjG">pic.twitter.com/Eq6cy7AyjG</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119261704609476802?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The music of Tommaso Ciampa hits, as he makes his way out and down to the ring.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Next up, Andrade El Idolo. The National Champion makes his way out and down to the ring.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>AEW National Championship Match: Andrade El Idolo defends against&nbsp;Tommaso Ciampa</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The bell rings, as we are underway! The fans chant psycho killer. Ciampa asks the ref to check Andrade&#8217;s pants. This allows Ciampa to take the early advantage. Andrade recovers as both men exchange blows. Andrade drops Ciampa with a lariat. Andrade goes to take his pants off, but is stopped by Ciampa. Andrade comes back and does the three amigos on Ciampa.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-FULL AD BREAK (ON HBO MAX)-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from the break, both men are up on the top rope. Andrade sends Ciampa hard to the mat. Ciampa is on the apron, as is starts to rain a bit, making the mat a bit slippery. Ciampa goes after Ciampa, but it looked like he slipped on his head after Andrade tried a powerslam attempt. The way the commentary team reacted, I am not sure this spot went off as planned. The ref checks on Ciampa who is in the ring holding his left elbow. I posted the spot from AEWs X.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">.<a href="https://x.com/AndradeElIdolo?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@AndradeElIdolo</a> capitalizes with a BRUTAL powerslam <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f628.png" alt="😨" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /><br><br>Watch <a href="https://x.com/hashtag/AEWCollision?src=hash&amp;ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">#AEWCollision</a>: Rock &amp; Wrestling Rager LIVE on TNT &amp; HBO Max! <a href="https://t.co/GNRRAXkSCl">pic.twitter.com/GNRRAXkSCl</a></p>&mdash; All Elite Wrestling (@AEW) <a href="https://x.com/AEW/status/2119264372174287269?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 8, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The action is back in the ring. Ciampa nails Andrade with a big boot to the face. Ciampa hits the psycho driller on Andrade from the second rope and cover Andrade for a two count. Ciampa tears off the pants of Andrade and stomps on him in the mid-section. Ciampa picks up Andrade, but Andrade lands on his feet. Ciampa runs at Andrade, but he moves as Ciampa takes out referee Aubrey Edwards. Andrade hits the DM on Ciampa. Andrade covers Ciampa, but the ref can&#8217;t make the count. Andrade checks on Aubrey, which allows Ciampa to low-blow Andrade and hit the exposed running knee. Ciampa covers Andrade, as Aubrey Edwards recovers, but Andrade kicks out at two! </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Andrade hits Ciampa in the side of the head and covers Ciampa for only a two count. Andrade hits Ciampa with an exposed knee in the side of jaw. Andrade covers Ciampa for only a two count! Ciampa rolls up Andrade and holds on to pin him as the rains starts to fall harder. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Winner by pinfall and new AEW National Champion: Tommaso Ciampa </strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After the match, Ciampa celebrates at ringside with his wife and daughter as the show goes off the air. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em><strong>-Touch ups and additions in progress-</strong></em></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/396827-aew-collision-results-11-7-26-live-from-chris-jerichos-rock-n-wrestling-rager-at-sea/">AEW Collision Results &#8211; 11/7/26 (Live From Chris Jericho&#8217;s Rock &#8216;N&#8217; Wrestling Rager at Sea)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
