		<item>
		<title>Report: Former champion&#8217;s TNA deal with the promotion set to expire at the end of the year</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/396959-report-former-champions-tna-deal-with-the-promotion-set-to-expire-at-the-end-of-the-year/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/396959-report-former-champions-tna-deal-with-the-promotion-set-to-expire-at-the-end-of-the-year/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 20:25:38 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Impact News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[contract]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Rich Swann]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=396959</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Fightful Select reports former TNA World Champion Rich Swann&#8217;s current contract with the promotion is set to expire&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/396959-report-former-champions-tna-deal-with-the-promotion-set-to-expire-at-the-end-of-the-year/">Report: Former champion&#8217;s TNA deal with the promotion set to expire at the end of the year</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Fightful Select reports former TNA World Champion Rich Swann&#8217;s current contract with the promotion is set to expire on December 31. He signed a short-term deal earlier this year.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">At the time of this writing, Fightful Select further notes there has been no confirmation if Swann and TNA have held discussions about a potential contract extension.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/396959-report-former-champions-tna-deal-with-the-promotion-set-to-expire-at-the-end-of-the-year/">Report: Former champion&#8217;s TNA deal with the promotion set to expire at the end of the year</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/396959-report-former-champions-tna-deal-with-the-promotion-set-to-expire-at-the-end-of-the-year/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
