		<item>
		<title>Titles change hands at WWE Crown Jewel on Saturday</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396880-titles-change-hands-at-wwe-crown-jewel-on-saturday/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396880-titles-change-hands-at-wwe-crown-jewel-on-saturday/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 18:22:19 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Austin Theory]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bron Breakker]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Crown Jewel]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Je'Von Evans]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Penta]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[World Tag Team Titles]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=396880</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Penta and Je&#8217;Von Evans are the new WWE World Tag Team Champions. Penta and Evans defeated The Vision&#8217;s&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/396880-titles-change-hands-at-wwe-crown-jewel-on-saturday/">Titles change hands at WWE Crown Jewel on Saturday</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Penta and Je&#8217;Von Evans are the new WWE World Tag Team Champions.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Penta and Evans defeated The Vision&#8217;s Bron Breakker and Austin Theory at Saturday&#8217;s Crown Jewel at ANB Arena in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Below is an excerpt from <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/top-story/396823-wwe-crown-jewel-results-11-7-26-mens-and-womens-crown-jewel-championships-and-more/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Alex Kahrs&#8217; WWE Crown Jewel recap</a> of how the title change went down.</p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Penta sends Breakker to the corner with a sling blade, and Evans gets a tag back in for a nearfall. Theory breaks the pin, garnering a “f–k you Austin” chant as he goes for a DDT…but Evans kicks out before making the tag to Penta! Penta takes Theory down for a cover, but Maxxine gets his foot on the rope to break the count. In the midst of all this, Bronson Reed comes through the crowd, pulling Penta out of the ring to land a Death Valley Driver on him to the floor.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He clotheslines Evans over the barricade before running away. Penta is brought back in the ring for a Doomsday Device by The Vision, but it’s only good for two! Reed is still hanging around at ringside as Oba Femi’s music hits, bringing out The Ruler. Reed goes after him up the ramp, but is sent through a table off the stage by Oba. Bron has a staredown with the fellow hoss from ringside, as Evans tries to go for a dive to no avail…but Penta connects with one from the top turnbuckle!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He goes after Theory back in the ring for a Mexican Destroyer, and Evans follows up with an OG Cutter for the win! We have new champs!</p>
</blockquote>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">.<a href="https://x.com/Obaofwwe?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@Obaofwwe</a> is HERE and he took out <a href="https://x.com/BRONSONISHERE?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@BRONSONISHERE</a> <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f631.png" alt="😱" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> <a href="https://t.co/k595gXCJgJ">pic.twitter.com/k595gXCJgJ</a></p>&mdash; WWE (@WWE) <a href="https://x.com/WWE/status/2119131509957259607?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 7, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<blockquote class="twitter-tweet" data-width="550" data-dnt="true"><p lang="en" dir="ltr">LET&#39;S GO!!!!<br><br>Congratulations <a href="https://x.com/PENTAELZEROM?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@PENTAELZEROM</a> and <a href="https://x.com/WWEJeVonEvans?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">@WWEJeVonEvans</a>!! <img src="https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/72x72/1f44f.png" alt="👏" class="wp-smiley" style="height: 1em; max-height: 1em;" /> <a href="https://t.co/b25DJxKo02">pic.twitter.com/b25DJxKo02</a></p>&mdash; WWE (@WWE) <a href="https://x.com/WWE/status/2119132041212031309?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">November 7, 2026</a></blockquote><script async src="https://platform.x.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script>
</div></figure>
